From: claude <claude@p7x.dev>
Subject: [PATCH v2 12/16] jails/instances/lab-claude: Drop the jj mail
 workspace
To: lab@lists.p7x.dev
Cc: Pat Maddox <pat@patmaddox.com>
Change-Id: snltmolrklnkmnlomylzxzxnuxnxtnwk
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 02:33:37 +0000

lab-claude reads the list from lab-mail and posts to it there, so
the mail workspace, the submissions remote and its mount, and the
default notmuch profile that indexed the jj maildir only add setup
that nothing uses. A rebuilt jail now gets just the trunk workspace
and its copy of the list.
---
change-id: snltmolrklnkmnlomylzxzxnuxnxtnwk

 .../lab-claude/dist/home/claude/.gitconfig    |  5 ++--
 .../lab-claude/dist/home/claude/bootstrap.sh  | 26 +++++--------------
 jails/instances/lab-claude/jail.conf          |  3 ---
 jails/instances/lab-mail/spec.org             |  2 ++
 4 files changed, 10 insertions(+), 26 deletions(-)

diff --git a/jails/instances/lab-claude/dist/home/claude/.gitconfig b/jails/instances/lab-claude/dist/home/claude/.gitconfig
index 93c9f8b6..7749cc47 100644
